WEBVTT

00:07:56.496 --> 00:08:01.954
because their work identity has become
linked with the course of action.

00:08:02.413 --> 00:08:06.746
People may even label the thing saying, Oh
, that project,

00:08:06.746 --> 00:08:09.621
that's Jim's baby or that's
Mary's project.

00:08:09.871 --> 00:08:14.288
And you become so identified with
it that if the project fails,

00:08:14.288 --> 00:08:15.954
your career is down the tubes.

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:19.704
Ironically, the very steps we
take to defend our egos

00:08:19.704 --> 00:08:22.204
and images end up making us look worse.

00:08:23.038 --> 00:08:25.704
One of the places Berry studied
this was the NBA.

00:08:26.371 --> 00:08:29.996
You'd think coaches would give the most
playing time to the best players,